THE CLEANEST CASE - the two stacks that are ALREADY unimodal
======================================================================================================================
  wrapped-text-1 and wrapped-text-2 are 0.0% and 1.4% multi-lobed (s23),
  so no restriction is being applied to them and no selection can bite.
  They are TWO SEPARATE CAPTURES of the same subject, which makes them
  the reproduction test - the same test section 16.7 used to refute
